WEBVTT

01:30.230 --> 01:34.950
[The Unclouded Soul]

01:35.229 --> 01:37.740
[Episode 11]

01:40.350 --> 01:42.710
Located near Qingyuan Mountain,
Pingjiang Prefecture

01:42.710 --> 01:43.970
was plagued by demons.

01:44.400 --> 01:47.680
This time, under imperial orders
to eradicate evil creatures,

01:47.680 --> 01:49.400
all Feiyu Guards worked day and night,

01:49.400 --> 01:51.000
showing absolute devotion.

01:51.070 --> 01:52.590
After several fierce battles,

01:52.590 --> 01:54.710
the Feiyu Guard slew over 100 demon beasts

01:54.710 --> 01:56.200
and multiple great demons.

01:56.200 --> 01:59.229
Among all battles, the one
in the Misty Forest was particularly hard.

01:59.229 --> 02:01.590
Fortunately, by the grace of Your Majesty,

02:01.590 --> 02:03.760
thanks to
Master Bingzhu's excellent command

02:03.760 --> 02:05.760
and the soldiers' valiant efforts,

02:05.950 --> 02:08.870
we finally executed the mountain elves
that had blighted the world for a century

02:08.870 --> 02:12.030
and Jin Muqing, Qionghua's sect leader,
whose soul had corrupted by evil,

02:12.030 --> 02:13.280
right on the spot.

02:16.150 --> 02:19.520
For a long time,
demons inflicted severe harm on Pingjiang.

02:19.750 --> 02:22.470
For this combat,
I motivated all individuals in Pingjiang,

02:22.470 --> 02:23.750
including military personnel
and civilians,

02:23.750 --> 02:25.079
to assist Feiyu Guards.

02:25.400 --> 02:28.270
I risked my life and possessions

02:28.400 --> 02:30.150
just to restore peace

02:30.150 --> 02:31.590
to the people.

02:33.100 --> 02:36.010
What are mountain elves?

02:36.400 --> 02:37.240
Your Majesty,

02:37.680 --> 02:40.610
they're survivors of Hefeng Tribe
from 20 years ago.

02:41.000 --> 02:42.520
Hefeng Tribe?

02:43.960 --> 02:46.160
Have you found any leads on Yuli Spring?

02:46.240 --> 02:47.040
Your Majesty,

02:47.240 --> 02:49.170
those dead mountain elves quickly

02:49.240 --> 02:50.500
decomposed into soil.

02:50.630 --> 02:51.710
To be on the safe side,

02:51.710 --> 02:52.710
I've ordered to have the soil

02:52.710 --> 02:54.000
that the elves were buried in

02:54.000 --> 02:55.460
all dug up and brought back

02:55.590 --> 02:57.150
for the Imperial Sorcerer to examine,

02:57.150 --> 02:58.680
in which there may be clues.

03:08.310 --> 03:10.630
Feiyu Guards did a great job
eliminating demons.

03:10.630 --> 03:13.360
Prefect Liu also deserves credit
for providing assistance.

03:13.360 --> 03:16.220
Good! You will all be rewarded
based on your merits.

03:16.310 --> 03:17.440
Thank Your Majesty.

03:17.590 --> 03:20.280
Thank Your Majesty.

03:23.280 --> 03:25.460
The Demon Slayer's presence

03:25.560 --> 03:29.630
is requested by His Majesty
in the Elixir Refining Chamber.

03:40.630 --> 03:43.750
I also have great news to tell you,
my loyal subject.

03:45.520 --> 03:46.560
A few days ago,

03:48.030 --> 03:51.280
moved by my piety, the Exalted Immortal

03:53.430 --> 03:55.120
descended to earth again.

03:59.240 --> 04:00.150
This time,

04:00.560 --> 04:03.800
the Exalted Immortal
agreed to accept my offerings.

04:05.160 --> 04:07.600
A hundred intelligent maidens

04:07.630 --> 04:11.230
shall be sent to Penglang
as attendants of the Exalted Immortal.

04:13.050 --> 04:17.170
Then maybe the celestial mountain barrier
will be removed early.

04:20.070 --> 04:21.920
I've thought it over.

04:24.720 --> 04:27.590
Girls from common families
tend to be coarse.

04:28.090 --> 04:30.020
So I opt for officials' daughters.

04:30.720 --> 04:32.580
This task is now entrusted to you.

04:33.270 --> 04:34.390
I need it done soon.

04:35.120 --> 04:36.720
When the girls are gathered,

04:36.830 --> 04:38.430
have them board a large ship.

04:38.830 --> 04:42.030
You will then personally escort them
to the destination.

04:46.070 --> 04:48.860
But, I think...

04:49.130 --> 04:52.150
What do you not understand,
my loyal subject?

04:58.620 --> 04:59.480
As Your Majesty

05:00.560 --> 05:01.160
commands.

05:10.170 --> 05:12.730
The things here
are even better than those in Pingjiang.

05:12.730 --> 05:14.270
Too bad that I've run out of money,

05:14.270 --> 05:15.600
so I can't buy anything.

05:17.040 --> 05:17.800
After traveling for days,

05:17.800 --> 05:20.240
my face has become as dry as an eggshell.

05:21.830 --> 05:23.040
You wilt in the heat

05:23.040 --> 05:24.890
when the sun gets high.

05:25.830 --> 05:28.560
So we have to hide during the day
and move at night.

05:29.120 --> 05:31.870
Now, all I want is to feed my stomach.

05:32.040 --> 05:34.070
But I can't conjure money at the moment.

05:34.070 --> 05:35.950
We must find Bingzhu as soon as possible.

05:35.950 --> 05:37.040
Don't worry, miss.

05:37.430 --> 05:39.240
If I were to let
such a beautiful lady like you

05:39.240 --> 05:40.640
struggle on the streets,

05:40.690 --> 05:42.020
wouldn't it be my fault?

05:42.800 --> 05:44.310
I have food and clothes at home.

05:44.310 --> 05:46.340
Why not come home with me, miss?

05:46.720 --> 05:48.450
I don't want to go home with you.

05:48.720 --> 05:49.600
I have an idea.

05:49.800 --> 05:50.950
Why don't you buy

05:50.950 --> 05:52.120
some life necessities

05:52.120 --> 05:53.860
for me and my friend right here?

05:53.880 --> 05:54.510
Sure.

05:55.190 --> 05:55.890
Well,

05:56.120 --> 05:58.060
we're looking for a friend.

05:58.680 --> 05:59.830
Do you know where we can find

05:59.830 --> 06:00.800
the Demon Slayer

06:00.800 --> 06:01.800
of the Feiyu Guard?

06:01.800 --> 06:02.950
The Demon Slayer of the Feiyu Guard?

06:02.950 --> 06:03.520
Yes.

06:05.680 --> 06:07.610
Why not ask to meet the Emperor too?

06:08.030 --> 06:09.120
You're crazy.

06:10.000 --> 06:11.640
How could you be so rude, sir?

06:11.830 --> 06:12.960
He just insulted us.

06:13.750 --> 06:15.040
When I'm telling the truth,

06:15.040 --> 06:16.970
others actually treat me as a liar.

06:17.310 --> 06:18.600
We were so close

06:18.600 --> 06:19.480
to persuading

06:19.480 --> 06:21.290
that man to spend money on us.

06:21.360 --> 06:23.680
Then you would have
had to go home with him.

06:23.680 --> 06:24.810
Silly you. Let's go.

06:25.250 --> 06:27.290
[The Matchmaker's Temple]

06:31.600 --> 06:33.260
If you're also in love with me,

06:33.330 --> 06:35.390
this knot of true love
will show a response

06:35.390 --> 06:36.600
once it is tied.

06:37.270 --> 06:38.470
Would you like to try?

06:39.310 --> 06:39.870
Sure.

06:54.000 --> 06:55.200
The knot of true love?

06:57.540 --> 06:58.250
Xiao Yao,

06:58.480 --> 07:00.240
would you like to tie a knot of true love

07:00.240 --> 07:01.640
to pray for His Lordship?

07:14.360 --> 07:15.040
Xiao Yao,

07:15.270 --> 07:16.070
come here!

07:17.720 --> 07:18.650
Listen,

07:18.830 --> 07:20.950
these intertwined branches
symbolize a bond for life.

07:20.950 --> 07:23.210
A knot of true love
is best to be tied here.

07:26.670 --> 07:29.480
I hope your heart feels what mine does.

07:29.750 --> 07:31.880
May my love be cherished and returned.

07:34.420 --> 07:35.620
I pray for your safety

07:36.390 --> 07:37.320
and mine as well.

07:38.290 --> 07:40.170
May all of us be safe

07:40.800 --> 07:41.390
and well.

07:47.740 --> 07:51.400
I've attached my consciousness
to this vine-wreathed bracelet.

07:51.610 --> 07:53.200
It will keep you safe.

07:59.070 --> 08:00.880
Xiao Yao, look who's here.

08:01.830 --> 08:02.870
God of Marriage, I wish

08:02.870 --> 08:04.430
-Master Bingzhu will fall in love with me.
-God of Marriage, I hope

08:04.430 --> 08:08.360
-to become Master Bingzhu's wife soon.
-Please have him propose to me.

08:08.800 --> 08:10.120
Do they look familiar to you?

08:10.120 --> 08:11.600
How can the younger sister get married

08:11.600 --> 08:12.800
before the older one does?

08:12.800 --> 08:14.830
You were just lusting after
my future husband.

08:14.830 --> 08:16.160
How could I not take action?

08:16.160 --> 08:17.160
You have no shame.

08:17.830 --> 08:20.560
-Lord Bingzhu
will only be your brother-in-law!
-But Dad already promised

08:20.560 --> 08:22.290
to marry me off to Lord Bingzhu.

08:24.630 --> 08:25.550
Not a chance!

08:26.650 --> 08:27.260
Let go!

08:27.660 --> 08:30.390
Who would've thought
Master Bingzhu could be so popular?

08:30.390 --> 08:31.560
Let's go find Dad like this then.

08:31.560 --> 08:32.559
Fine, let's do it!

08:34.390 --> 08:35.360
Since the two of them are here,

08:35.360 --> 08:36.890
the Prefect must be nearby.

08:36.909 --> 08:37.630
If we follow them,

08:37.630 --> 08:39.000
maybe we'll find Bingzhu.

08:39.000 --> 08:39.710
That's right.

08:39.710 --> 08:40.240
Let's go!

08:40.510 --> 08:40.960
I'll tell my dad!

08:40.960 --> 08:42.390
So will I, as he's my dad too!

08:42.390 --> 08:43.120
He's my dad!

08:43.120 --> 08:44.250
-Mine too!
-Ladies!

08:49.840 --> 08:50.670
You punks!

08:53.140 --> 08:53.840
Let's go.

08:53.840 --> 08:55.500
Why waste time on these punks?

08:56.080 --> 08:56.820
Ladies,

08:57.120 --> 08:59.100
since you're here
in the Matchmaker's Temple,

08:59.100 --> 09:01.640
I bet you're looking for ideal husbands.

09:02.150 --> 09:04.540
Why not let me

09:04.870 --> 09:07.790
make your dreams come true?

09:07.790 --> 09:08.400
Scram!

09:10.390 --> 09:12.360
She actually told me to scram.

09:12.870 --> 09:13.840
Feisty girls.

09:14.120 --> 09:15.250
Exactly what I like.

09:21.550 --> 09:22.210
It's money.

09:25.090 --> 09:28.240
I once had a bowl of noodles
that was worth several hundred taels.

09:28.240 --> 09:29.900
You think I'd care about this?

09:30.200 --> 09:30.730
Let's go.

09:30.870 --> 09:31.800
We don't want it!

09:32.430 --> 09:33.690
What's wrong with you?

09:36.950 --> 09:39.670
Ladies, you're like
precious and beautiful blossoms

09:39.670 --> 09:41.250
that share a stem,

09:41.530 --> 09:44.510
yet the noble bearing
you exude is not to be ignored.

09:45.210 --> 09:47.810
He even conjured a flower
out of thin air for me.

09:47.870 --> 09:49.930
Does he have any idea what I really am?

09:54.620 --> 09:55.890
What are you waiting for?

09:55.890 --> 09:57.950
-Beat them up!
-How dare you punch me?

09:58.080 --> 09:58.920
Run!

10:00.120 --> 10:00.600
Are you okay?

10:00.600 --> 10:01.390
Catch them!

10:01.430 --> 10:02.320
Take them down!

10:02.550 --> 10:03.530
Run!

10:03.720 --> 10:05.050
Don't let them get away!

10:05.870 --> 10:06.750
Hands off me!

10:06.870 --> 10:07.610
Xiao Yao!

10:09.150 --> 10:10.210
Trying to run away?

10:11.630 --> 10:13.160
I won't let you go anywhere!

10:15.390 --> 10:16.320
Hold them tight!

10:24.550 --> 10:25.680
This is the capital,

10:25.870 --> 10:27.240
the most civilized area of the nation.

10:27.240 --> 10:28.600
For harassing common girls,

10:28.600 --> 10:30.000
you deserve punishment.

10:31.670 --> 10:32.860
B-Boss...

10:33.150 --> 10:35.080
D-do you know who I am?

10:35.200 --> 10:37.220
My dad is the Chief Inspector.

10:37.390 --> 10:39.480
I'm his eldest legitimate son!

10:39.480 --> 10:40.030
Get lost!

10:40.030 --> 10:40.790
I...

10:41.240 --> 10:43.020
If you dare say one more word,

10:43.270 --> 10:46.130
the Demon Slayer will...
My Lord, beat him to death!

10:46.790 --> 10:48.050
I'll beat you to death!

10:48.790 --> 10:49.430
Guys, run!

10:52.360 --> 10:53.820
-I dare you to...
-Go away!

10:54.750 --> 10:56.320
I'll get back at you!

10:59.150 --> 10:59.950
Lord Bingzhu.

11:00.390 --> 11:02.250
What are you doing in the capital?

11:03.750 --> 11:04.810
We're here for you.

11:05.240 --> 11:08.300
There's a chance for you
to perform a meritorious deed.

11:08.390 --> 11:09.270
But now we're starving

11:09.270 --> 11:11.390
and exhausted
from the journey to find you.

11:11.390 --> 11:12.050
Well,

11:12.120 --> 11:14.570
do you mind showing some hospitality?

11:21.910 --> 11:23.150
What do you think? Is it good?

11:23.150 --> 11:23.790
It's amazing!

11:23.790 --> 11:25.470
Luoluo would definitely love this.

11:25.470 --> 11:26.670
Here, have some more.

11:28.600 --> 11:30.730
-Thank you.
-Thank you, Lord Bingzhu.

11:32.110 --> 11:33.020
What are these?

11:33.270 --> 11:34.600
Candied haws on a stick.

11:38.030 --> 11:39.140
Sweet or sour?

11:39.260 --> 11:40.360
Both!

11:40.360 --> 11:41.030
Yeah!

11:42.000 --> 11:43.960
This is worth all the trouble
we've been through.

11:43.960 --> 11:45.490
Do demons cultivate so hard

11:45.790 --> 11:48.900
just to enjoy delicious food
in the human realm?

11:50.870 --> 11:53.120
The human realm
offers so much more than food.

11:53.120 --> 11:54.550
Being human is wonderful.

11:54.550 --> 11:56.030
There's endless joy for humans.

11:56.030 --> 11:57.680
Back then as a flower,

11:57.960 --> 11:59.150
I always envied human women

11:59.150 --> 12:00.360
whenever I saw them.

12:00.720 --> 12:02.550
They got to wear all sorts of clothes

12:02.550 --> 12:04.480
and style their hair in various ways.

12:04.480 --> 12:07.180
As they put on different make-up products,

12:07.270 --> 12:09.930
another kind of beauty
would instantly appear.

12:10.240 --> 12:11.850
While admiring them,

12:12.000 --> 12:13.590
I was cultivating hard.

12:13.870 --> 12:15.220
That made me who I am today.

12:15.220 --> 12:16.390
But my effort's far from enough.

12:16.390 --> 12:18.050
I must continue cultivating.

12:20.360 --> 12:21.020
Therefore,

12:21.440 --> 12:22.480
I'm afraid nobody but you

12:22.480 --> 12:25.280
and Tan'er can be a match
for Dreamshard Immortal.

12:28.870 --> 12:29.670
Xiao Yao,

12:30.270 --> 12:31.360
you know me well.

12:32.080 --> 12:34.510
That's why you talked about
going to the Realm of Mist and Void

12:34.510 --> 12:35.960
to eliminate evil spirits.

12:35.960 --> 12:37.290
But I also know you well.

12:37.480 --> 12:39.480
You're full of crafty and wicked ideas.

12:39.480 --> 12:40.960
If you're planning to use me

12:40.960 --> 12:43.000
to wipe out the Demon King's enemies,

12:43.000 --> 12:44.260
then you're barking up

12:44.670 --> 12:45.530
the wrong tree.

12:45.990 --> 12:47.390
-Don't you judge me by...
-Come on.

12:47.390 --> 12:48.650
Show him the portrait.

12:50.080 --> 12:52.080
This can prove what our words can't.

13:04.960 --> 13:05.630
Look.

13:05.840 --> 13:07.910
We've all met her on Qingyuan Mountain.

13:07.910 --> 13:09.910
Don't you see I'm telling the truth?

13:10.440 --> 13:11.390
If I'm lying to you,

13:11.390 --> 13:13.650
may I be penniless
for the rest of my life.

13:13.670 --> 13:14.240
Yeah.

13:15.670 --> 13:16.320
She...

13:17.270 --> 13:18.330
is in fact a spirit?

13:18.670 --> 13:20.750
Dreamshard Immortal was a divine being

13:20.750 --> 13:22.270
until she left the celestial mountain

13:22.270 --> 13:24.240
and was corrupted by worldly desires.

13:24.240 --> 13:25.670
She could no longer
focus on her cultivation

13:25.670 --> 13:27.070
and thus became a spirit.

13:27.080 --> 13:29.910
She has long fed on the essence
of young women to preserve her appearance,

13:29.910 --> 13:32.150
earning the label
"ruthless and merciless."

13:32.150 --> 13:35.750
Don't you think you should purge the world
of such an evil spirit?

13:44.270 --> 13:45.240
Where exactly

13:46.600 --> 13:48.200
is the Realm of Mist and Void?

13:49.910 --> 13:51.240
We don't know.

13:52.080 --> 13:53.480
That's why we came to you.

14:04.720 --> 14:05.790
What is he doing?

14:12.140 --> 14:15.740
This is the most inclusive nautical chart
in Tiansheng Kingdom.

14:16.030 --> 14:18.150
All the islands that humans have visited

14:18.150 --> 14:19.210
are recorded on it.

14:20.690 --> 14:22.110
[Lifeng Island] [Hupo Islet]

14:20.870 --> 14:22.270
Our target's not here...

14:23.220 --> 14:23.990
[Penglang]

14:25.080 --> 14:26.510
This is what humans call
the Realm of Mist and Void,

14:26.490 --> 14:28.400
[Penglang]

14:26.870 --> 14:27.840
"Penglang."

14:34.270 --> 14:35.320
Penglang?

15:15.540 --> 15:16.950
Dreamshard Immortal,

15:20.030 --> 15:21.390
emerge now.

15:39.510 --> 15:40.360
Hong Ye.

15:45.270 --> 15:46.670
You're free-spirited

15:47.620 --> 15:48.770
and unrestrained.

15:49.870 --> 15:51.730
Even a thousand years of hardship

15:52.750 --> 15:54.360
couldn't tame you.

15:55.870 --> 15:56.990
Yet for my sake,

15:57.860 --> 16:00.680
you've been put through
all the Eight Sufferings of a human life

16:00.680 --> 16:02.280
and left with a broken heart.

16:03.030 --> 16:05.480
I'm the one who made you this way.

16:06.790 --> 16:07.600
Hong Ye.

16:10.440 --> 16:11.630
This is all my fault.

16:12.840 --> 16:14.200
I have no regrets.

16:19.480 --> 16:20.240
Hong Ye.

16:22.790 --> 16:24.300
Never has a moment gone by

16:24.750 --> 16:26.480
without me feeling miserable.

16:28.240 --> 16:30.240
Give me a chance to atone for my sins.

16:31.030 --> 16:32.360
Let's start over,

16:33.080 --> 16:33.870
shall we?

17:25.640 --> 17:26.349
Hong Ye.

17:28.640 --> 17:29.510
Look at me.

17:30.550 --> 17:31.480
I am Xiao Yao.

17:41.400 --> 17:42.660
Ning'an betrayed you,

17:43.640 --> 17:44.400
but I won't.

17:47.350 --> 17:48.480
You could forsake

17:49.160 --> 17:50.480
your life for Ning'an.

17:51.680 --> 17:52.740
Then what about me?

17:53.440 --> 17:54.570
Will you do anything

17:55.440 --> 17:56.550
for me?

18:05.550 --> 18:06.310
Yes, I will.

18:11.590 --> 18:12.310
Very well.

18:28.070 --> 18:30.400
You're voluntarily giving me your heart.

18:31.400 --> 18:33.840
A human feels no pain without a heart.

18:34.680 --> 18:35.960
So does a demon.

18:44.720 --> 18:45.630
This is right.

18:45.650 --> 18:47.160
It's her.

18:47.180 --> 18:48.110
Exactly her.

18:49.440 --> 18:52.460
It's like you can read my mind,
my loyal subject.

18:52.960 --> 18:56.440
She's the Exalted Immortal
I told you about.

18:57.200 --> 18:59.550
This painting captures her perfectly.

19:00.000 --> 19:00.800
Your Majesty,

19:01.590 --> 19:04.680
when I reviewed the Feiyu Guard's
secret archives yesterday,

19:04.680 --> 19:07.000
I learned about the existence
of certain spirits

19:07.000 --> 19:08.750
that specialize in bewitching people

19:08.750 --> 19:10.680
and feed on the essence of maidens.

19:11.240 --> 19:13.310
This, in my opinion, is a serious issue.

19:13.310 --> 19:17.200
I propose to verify the identity
of the Exalted Immortal before sending

19:17.200 --> 19:19.060
girls to the celestial mountain.

19:19.350 --> 19:20.920
Are you indicating...

19:22.270 --> 19:24.200
that I'm a foolish and incompetent ruler

19:24.200 --> 19:26.130
who has been bewitched by a spirit?

19:26.960 --> 19:28.290
I don't mean any of that.

19:28.400 --> 19:30.050
I'm only imploring Your Majesty to wait

19:30.050 --> 19:32.380
till I figure out the truth about spirits.

19:32.430 --> 19:33.310
Wait?

19:34.440 --> 19:36.970
Till your investigation's over
or till I die?

19:38.070 --> 19:38.880
My apologies!

19:39.590 --> 19:42.510
Your Majesty shall live for ever and ever!

19:51.270 --> 19:52.960
Quickly gather 100 maidens.

19:54.750 --> 19:55.960
Set sail soon.

19:56.790 --> 19:58.030
No delay is allowed.

19:59.510 --> 20:00.370
As Your Majesty

20:00.790 --> 20:01.790
commands.

20:16.590 --> 20:18.050
Tan'er, you want to go too?

20:20.070 --> 20:22.270
This trip is to the lair of evil spirits.

20:22.350 --> 20:23.880
Extreme danger lies ahead,

20:23.920 --> 20:25.780
yet I cannot mobilize any troops.

20:26.310 --> 20:27.280
What if we...

20:33.400 --> 20:35.730
Are you really this eager
to help Xiao Yao?

20:36.830 --> 20:37.630
Demon Slayer,

20:37.880 --> 20:39.680
the Feiyu Guard has assembled.

20:40.740 --> 20:48.100
[Tianwei Gate]

20:43.550 --> 20:45.810
The Feiyu Guard is ordered by His Majesty

20:46.350 --> 20:47.610
to bring the daughters

20:47.790 --> 20:49.070
of officials of sixth rank and above,

20:49.070 --> 20:50.400
who, under the age of 18,

20:51.030 --> 20:52.270
must be of good character and appearance,

20:52.270 --> 20:54.700
out of the city gate at 3 p.m.,

20:54.790 --> 20:57.270
so as to ship them to serve
the Exalted Immortal.

20:57.270 --> 20:58.270
Do arrive on time!

20:58.350 --> 20:59.070
Yes!

21:08.350 --> 21:09.030
[Li Residence]

21:15.000 --> 21:16.310
We the Feiyu Guards are acting
on imperial orders.

21:16.310 --> 21:17.160
Those who dare to disobey

21:17.160 --> 21:19.480
will be punished
for defiance of the Emperor's will.

21:19.480 --> 21:20.200
Let go of me!

21:20.790 --> 21:21.510
My daughter!

21:21.510 --> 21:22.000
Mom!

21:22.480 --> 21:22.790
Mom!

21:22.790 --> 21:23.270
Hands off her!

21:23.270 --> 21:23.880
Take the girl away!

21:23.880 --> 21:24.590
Mom!

21:26.300 --> 21:28.960
[Li Residence]

21:26.350 --> 21:26.790
Move!

21:26.790 --> 21:27.270
Let go of me!

21:27.270 --> 21:28.000
Keep moving!

21:28.400 --> 21:29.060
Let go of me!

21:29.200 --> 21:29.830
Dad!

21:30.480 --> 21:31.110
Mom!

21:31.880 --> 21:32.550
Dad!

21:33.400 --> 21:34.030
Dad!

21:36.220 --> 21:38.050
What's the use of being an official?

21:38.050 --> 21:40.380
You can't even protect your own daughter!

21:45.640 --> 21:46.750
Ease up a little!

21:46.780 --> 21:48.240
What's the matter with you?

21:48.240 --> 21:49.300
Bear with me, miss.

21:52.490 --> 21:55.630
[Residence of Demon Slayer]

22:01.680 --> 22:02.920
Xiao Yao, Dali.

22:04.030 --> 22:05.680
It's quite a distance
to the Realm of Mist and Void.

22:05.680 --> 22:07.110
I believe you need to buy supplies

22:07.110 --> 22:08.710
for unexpected situations.

22:09.920 --> 22:11.980
Have you figured out how to get there?

22:12.480 --> 22:13.340
Not yet.

22:13.790 --> 22:14.920
But once we're at sea,

22:14.920 --> 22:17.160
Dreamshard will surely come to guide us.

22:17.160 --> 22:18.290
Just take the money.

22:19.680 --> 22:20.680
Alright, thanks.

22:20.880 --> 22:21.920
The sun's intense out at sea.

22:21.920 --> 22:24.240
We'll need plenty of makeup products
and spare clothes.

22:24.240 --> 22:24.640
Right.

22:25.070 --> 22:26.270
Let me smell it again.

22:26.570 --> 22:28.630
-What a lovely scent.
-How fragrant.

22:29.950 --> 22:30.950
You like that too?

22:31.310 --> 22:32.170
When we return,

22:32.270 --> 22:33.700
I'll get you a new sheath.

22:40.060 --> 22:41.630
Tan'er, this is for you.

22:47.830 --> 22:50.370
We didn't get to draw a fortune stick
last time at the Matchmaker's Temple.

22:50.370 --> 22:51.240
Why don't we...

22:53.310 --> 22:54.510
Draw a fortune stick?

22:54.550 --> 22:55.000
Yes.

22:55.030 --> 22:55.640
Yes.

22:55.830 --> 22:56.420
Let's go.

23:00.110 --> 23:03.380
[God of Marriage]

23:00.400 --> 23:01.920
There are so many people here.

23:01.920 --> 23:03.680
I bet today is an auspicious day.

23:03.680 --> 23:04.160
I agree.

23:04.200 --> 23:05.110
Let's hang ours over there.

23:05.110 --> 23:05.750
Sure.

23:18.000 --> 23:19.600
I'll go draw a fortune stick.

23:29.830 --> 23:30.640
An auspicious omen?

23:30.640 --> 23:31.400
No way. I'll try again.

23:31.400 --> 23:32.730
That one doesn't count.

23:34.440 --> 23:35.500
Let me check it out.

23:40.350 --> 23:42.920
"Thrivingly the golden bough
and jade leave grow."

23:42.920 --> 23:45.580
"No wind, frost, rain, or snow
can lay them low."

23:45.600 --> 23:47.030
What an auspicious lot.

23:47.270 --> 23:49.270
It's a stroke of supreme luck, Dali.

23:49.350 --> 23:50.310
Terrific!

23:49.530 --> 23:50.420
[Supreme Luck]

23:51.960 --> 23:53.440
So you're able to interpret
fortune sticks, My Lord.

23:53.440 --> 23:55.290
Xiao Yao, I drew a highly auspicious lot.

23:55.290 --> 23:56.820
You should draw a stick too.

23:57.200 --> 23:59.400
-Fancy a try?
-I got the best of fortune.

24:03.000 --> 24:03.860
I want a new one.

24:07.030 --> 24:09.160
Please explain the note to me, My Lord.

24:13.760 --> 24:16.420
"A perfect union was forged
at the dawn of time."

24:16.920 --> 24:19.870
"The timing is good,
and all things in bliss are laid."

24:19.870 --> 24:22.330
"Do not ignore this message,
lucky fellow."

24:22.330 --> 24:24.630
"You will be blessed with joy
and many children."

24:24.630 --> 24:25.110
This...

24:26.240 --> 24:28.280
This is the best of all sticks
marked with "Supreme Luck"!

24:26.510 --> 24:28.000
[Supreme Luck]

24:28.830 --> 24:29.440
Xiao Yao,

24:29.920 --> 24:31.120
you're in great luck!

24:31.260 --> 24:32.380
That's wonderful!

24:32.590 --> 24:34.310
Thank you for the kind words, My Lord.

24:34.310 --> 24:36.310
There's fresh water in the room for you.

24:36.310 --> 24:37.590
Freshen up and get changed.

24:37.590 --> 24:38.480
I'll be waiting outside.

24:38.480 --> 24:38.880
Got it.

24:39.030 --> 24:39.400
Yes.

24:42.240 --> 24:43.480
He's actually nice.

24:52.270 --> 24:53.640
Why are you locking the door?

24:53.640 --> 24:54.590
Let me out!

24:54.590 --> 24:55.110
Stay away from the door.

24:55.110 --> 24:56.160
Let me out!

24:57.960 --> 24:58.750
What happened?

24:58.750 --> 25:00.280
Bingzhu, what are you up to?

25:00.640 --> 25:02.510
Xiao Yao, don't worry.

25:02.680 --> 25:04.070
I will go to the Realm of Mist and Void

25:04.070 --> 25:06.670
to destroy that devil spirit
with my own hands.

25:09.160 --> 25:11.160
Dreamshard is cunning and deceitful.

25:11.160 --> 25:12.820
This trip could be a tough one.

25:12.960 --> 25:14.720
Your involvement will only serve

25:14.720 --> 25:16.250
to increase the burden on me

25:16.310 --> 25:17.840
without offering any help.

25:18.310 --> 25:20.110
It's better for you to wait here,

25:20.170 --> 25:22.430
so you won't lose your lives for nothing.

25:23.660 --> 25:25.690
How long do we have to stay here?

25:26.510 --> 25:28.570
The charm will lose effect in 10 days.

25:29.110 --> 25:30.720
The food and water inside

25:31.550 --> 25:32.920
will last you 10 days.

25:38.200 --> 25:39.460
If I can't make it back,

25:39.880 --> 25:41.280
don't bother to go there.

25:44.440 --> 25:45.970
Focus on your cultivation,

25:46.480 --> 25:47.920
and don't harm people.

25:58.770 --> 26:01.170
Lord Bingzhu,
come back to talk it through!

26:05.480 --> 26:07.880
No wonder he prepared so much food for us.

26:07.880 --> 26:10.000
It turns out
he planned to confine us here.

26:10.000 --> 26:12.260
What's there to do?
We must find a way out.

26:12.400 --> 26:13.680
Or there won't be sunshine

26:13.680 --> 26:14.720
for me in the next 10 days!

26:14.720 --> 26:15.520
What can we do?

26:15.590 --> 26:17.850
It's 10 whole days. His Lordship will...

26:18.160 --> 26:19.760
Xiao Yao, what are you doing?

26:20.480 --> 26:23.310
No harm can be caused
when our hands are away from the charm.

26:23.310 --> 26:25.040
Good thing I was well prepared.

26:25.680 --> 26:27.940
Seems like you braced yourself for this.

26:28.110 --> 26:30.110
How did you know he wouldn't let us go?

26:30.110 --> 26:32.640
Demons are behind
every unusual occurrence.

26:32.720 --> 26:33.070
He...

26:33.070 --> 26:34.670
Aren't we demons ourselves?

26:36.880 --> 26:39.080
He suddenly spent so much money on us

26:39.350 --> 26:42.010
and rigged the fortune sticks
with lame tricks.

26:42.720 --> 26:43.350
Lord Bingzhu's ways

26:43.350 --> 26:45.780
of pleasing girls are so corny.

26:45.920 --> 26:47.320
I must teach him a thing or two
next time I see him.

26:47.320 --> 26:48.680
How are you so clever?

26:48.680 --> 26:50.030
It would take me more than a lifetime
to realize that.

26:50.030 --> 26:51.560
I was thinking... What now?

26:56.450 --> 26:56.980
Let's go.

26:58.160 --> 26:58.980
Wait.

26:59.310 --> 27:00.430
I'll take all that stuff with me.

27:00.430 --> 27:02.230
I've decided to spend his money.

27:03.400 --> 27:05.110
I'll take everything he bought us.

27:05.110 --> 27:06.400
Bingzhu is not very nice,

27:06.400 --> 27:08.110
but the things he bought are quite nice.

27:08.110 --> 27:09.350
Don't take too many things!

27:09.350 --> 27:10.750
-Get in there!
-No!

27:11.400 --> 27:11.640
Go in!

27:11.640 --> 27:12.030
Sir!

27:12.030 --> 27:12.750
I hear you! Just a moment!

27:12.750 --> 27:13.750
I'm stuck, Dad.

27:20.070 --> 27:22.510
Congratulations, sir.
Two wonderful things have happened to you.

27:22.510 --> 27:24.750
Right after receiving a decree
for a promotion,

27:24.750 --> 27:25.880
your daughters are now given

27:25.880 --> 27:28.270
the honor of serving the Exalted Immortal.

27:28.270 --> 27:30.000
How very delightful.

27:30.830 --> 27:33.030
Officer, my two daughters

27:33.030 --> 27:34.030
love to play.

27:34.200 --> 27:36.460
They're still away, hanging out in town.

27:37.030 --> 27:38.030
In that case,

27:38.030 --> 27:39.890
please let my men search the room,

27:40.110 --> 27:41.510
so we can complete our task.

27:41.510 --> 27:43.270
Officer, my two daughters

27:43.270 --> 27:44.350
are rather vulgar.

27:44.350 --> 27:47.070
They're not suited to be attendants
for the Exalted Immortal.

27:47.070 --> 27:48.000
Dad!

27:48.000 --> 27:48.980
Mom!

27:50.000 --> 27:52.030
We're back!

27:52.030 --> 27:52.640
Dad,

27:52.640 --> 27:53.550
why didn't you tell me

27:53.550 --> 27:55.480
and my sister such wonderful news?

27:55.640 --> 27:56.830
We heard about it.

27:56.830 --> 27:57.640
By imperial decree,

27:57.640 --> 28:00.200
we have the privilege
to serve an immortal in Penglang.

28:00.200 --> 28:01.440
That's right. Sis,

28:01.440 --> 28:02.510
we'd better hurry.

28:02.510 --> 28:04.110
It's said that only 100 girls are needed.

28:04.110 --> 28:04.920
If we arrive too late,

28:04.920 --> 28:06.440
this golden opportunity will slip by.

28:06.440 --> 28:07.030
Right?

28:07.270 --> 28:08.160
Right, sis.

28:08.160 --> 28:08.590
Yeah.

28:08.590 --> 28:09.160
Dad.

28:09.160 --> 28:09.880
Mom.

28:09.880 --> 28:10.790
Don't worry,

28:10.790 --> 28:12.070
We will surely

28:12.070 --> 28:13.200
bring honor to you!

28:14.240 --> 28:15.000
Officer,

28:15.000 --> 28:16.070
please wait a moment.

28:16.070 --> 28:18.110
We'll go with you after getting changed.

28:18.110 --> 28:19.000
Wait for us!

28:19.250 --> 28:20.310
Don't go anywhere!

28:22.900 --> 28:23.660
Hurry!

28:25.000 --> 28:27.590
Sir, unlike what you said,
your daughters are actually

28:27.590 --> 28:29.270
more fun than vulgar.

28:29.570 --> 28:30.160
Goodbye.

28:37.360 --> 28:37.880
My love.

28:39.410 --> 28:39.960
Come on.

28:39.990 --> 28:40.790
Punch me.

28:47.850 --> 28:49.180
So this is not a dream.

28:49.750 --> 28:50.720
It really is not a dream!

28:50.720 --> 28:51.980
It isn't, Master!

28:53.070 --> 28:53.480
Oh no!

28:53.500 --> 28:54.230
Sweetheart!

28:54.400 --> 28:54.960
Sweetheart.

28:54.960 --> 28:55.240
Sweetheart!

28:55.240 --> 28:56.370
You're safe now.

28:56.590 --> 28:57.310
All is fine.

28:57.880 --> 28:59.030
My dear daughter.

28:59.030 --> 28:59.550
Mom!

28:59.550 --> 29:00.310
I got my belly stuck.

29:00.310 --> 29:01.640
I know, I know.

29:01.750 --> 29:02.880
It's alright now.

29:05.640 --> 29:06.440
What is this about?

29:06.440 --> 29:07.810
Why bring us here?

29:12.720 --> 29:14.380
What did we do to deserve this?

29:15.310 --> 29:17.030
Everyone, please don't worry.

29:17.030 --> 29:18.090
By imperial order,

29:18.510 --> 29:20.480
you'll embark on a journey to Penglang

29:20.480 --> 29:22.210
to serve the Exalted Immortal.

29:22.240 --> 29:23.770
This is a great opportunity

29:23.790 --> 29:25.120
and a tremendous honor.

29:25.920 --> 29:27.050
Should your fathers

29:27.160 --> 29:29.110
and brothers are officials, they'll be

29:29.110 --> 29:31.040
promoted and conferred nobility.

29:31.960 --> 29:32.640
Really?

29:32.960 --> 29:33.590
Now,

29:34.110 --> 29:36.030
I hope you can trust me.

29:36.590 --> 29:39.720
I will personally escort you all
to the celestial mountain

29:39.720 --> 29:42.380
and ensure your safety
throughout the journey.

29:42.720 --> 29:43.720
Is everyone here?

29:44.310 --> 29:46.170
My Lord, we're short of two girls.

29:49.350 --> 29:50.110
My Lord, I'm sorry

29:50.110 --> 29:51.030
for being late.

29:56.920 --> 29:57.450
This way.

29:57.640 --> 29:58.400
Move over.

30:03.110 --> 30:03.910
He spotted us.

30:09.030 --> 30:09.830
Demon Slayer,

30:10.160 --> 30:12.490
it's already 3 p.m.
All the girls are here.

30:15.830 --> 30:16.590
Then set off.

30:17.200 --> 30:17.750
Yes.

30:22.750 --> 30:23.560
Stop crying!

30:24.110 --> 30:24.840
Get onboard!

30:26.480 --> 30:27.510
Keep up!

30:28.720 --> 30:29.520
Commander Ji,

30:31.590 --> 30:33.880
disembark with your people
when the girls settle in.

30:33.880 --> 30:35.280
No need to travel with us.

30:36.680 --> 30:39.160
We will pray for you in the capital,
My Lord.

30:50.790 --> 30:51.790
May I ask, My Lord,

30:52.030 --> 30:54.680
what direction should the ship head in?

30:58.110 --> 30:59.310
Toward the open sea!

31:01.240 --> 31:02.480
Pardon me, My Lord.

31:02.880 --> 31:04.830
The sea is unpredictable.

31:05.110 --> 31:07.290
I can't steer properly

31:07.550 --> 31:09.640
without specific instructions.

31:09.640 --> 31:10.400
Don't worry.

31:11.400 --> 31:12.600
When we're out at sea,

31:13.200 --> 31:15.530
someone will point out a direction for us.

31:15.880 --> 31:16.310
Yes!

31:27.200 --> 31:30.790
Exalted Immortal,
we're ready to serve you wholeheartedly.

31:30.790 --> 31:34.240
Please point us in the right direction!

31:35.750 --> 31:39.510
Exalted Immortal,
we're ready to serve you wholeheartedly.

31:39.510 --> 31:42.750
Please point us in the right direction!

31:47.070 --> 31:50.750
Exalted Immortal,
we're ready to serve you wholeheartedly.

31:50.750 --> 31:53.920
Please point us in the right direction!

31:56.240 --> 31:57.500
Dreamshard Immortal,

31:58.270 --> 32:00.030
you summoned us here!

32:01.960 --> 32:03.270
Dreamshard Immortal,

32:04.330 --> 32:06.570
it was you who summoned us here!

32:09.070 --> 32:10.680
Dreamshard Immortal,

32:11.000 --> 32:14.160
it was you who summoned us here!

32:14.270 --> 32:17.030
Please point us in the right direction!

32:17.830 --> 32:21.230
Exalted Immortal,
we're ready to serve you wholeheartedly.

32:21.500 --> 32:24.500
Please point us in the right direction!

32:28.310 --> 32:29.240
The sun's out!

32:29.240 --> 32:32.790
Exalted Immortal,
we're ready to serve you wholeheartedly.

32:33.200 --> 32:36.270
Please point us in the right direction!

32:40.880 --> 32:43.070
Celestial mountain.
That's the celestial mountain!

32:43.070 --> 32:43.880
Xiao Yao,

32:43.880 --> 32:44.510
look!

32:44.920 --> 32:46.160
The Exalted Immortal
has exerted her power!

32:46.160 --> 32:47.270
We survived!

32:47.510 --> 32:49.710
Will we meet the Exalted Immortal soon?

32:50.310 --> 32:52.240
Xiao Yao, let's go check it out too.

32:53.310 --> 32:54.220
Look at that!

32:54.480 --> 32:55.270
It's real!

32:55.270 --> 32:56.060
We're saved!

32:56.640 --> 32:57.400
We're saved!

32:58.440 --> 32:59.270
Stay calm.

33:00.550 --> 33:01.310
Be composed.

33:02.920 --> 33:03.790
Calm down.

33:04.240 --> 33:05.880
I thought we were doomed,

33:05.880 --> 33:07.590
but we surprisingly survived
and are now even looking

33:07.590 --> 33:09.000
at the celestial mountain!

33:09.000 --> 33:09.920
Indeed.

33:09.920 --> 33:13.270
The celestial mountain
is said to be extremely difficult to find.

33:13.270 --> 33:15.030
We're truly blessed
by the Exalted Immortal!

33:15.030 --> 33:16.070
Does it mean we can drink

33:16.070 --> 33:17.960
from Yuli Spring in the celestial mountain

33:17.960 --> 33:19.220
and gain immortality?

33:19.310 --> 33:20.070
Immortality?

33:20.070 --> 33:21.400
Look, it's right there!

33:23.350 --> 33:24.680
You'll find yourselves

33:25.110 --> 33:27.510
in a perilous location upon disembarking.

33:27.550 --> 33:29.350
Remember to always stay cautious

33:29.350 --> 33:30.480
and ward off danger.

33:33.720 --> 33:34.600
Hong Ye,

33:35.200 --> 33:36.960
I'll see you soon.

33:45.440 --> 33:46.680
What a spectacle!

33:51.240 --> 33:52.590
Is this the immortal realm?

33:52.590 --> 33:54.150
Am I in a dream or what?

33:56.240 --> 33:57.070
We must be close to Yuli Spring,

33:57.070 --> 33:58.830
now that we've reached the immortal realm.

33:58.830 --> 34:01.430
I've never seen
these many beautiful flowers.

34:07.270 --> 34:08.540
Such a lovely place.

34:13.480 --> 34:14.280
Stay in order.

34:14.440 --> 34:15.550
Everyone, stay in order.

34:15.550 --> 34:16.610
Mind your manners.

34:17.480 --> 34:19.310
You're just a mere Demon Slayer.

34:19.400 --> 34:20.850
What rank do you hold?

34:21.400 --> 34:23.810
You already bossed us around on the ship,

34:24.360 --> 34:26.760
and now you're still brazenly bullying us.

34:29.570 --> 34:31.230
Someone's here to receive us!

34:33.000 --> 34:34.150
Fairies!

34:35.440 --> 34:36.790
They're fairies!

34:37.150 --> 34:38.010
Here they come!

34:40.760 --> 34:42.159
Fairies have descended!

34:42.670 --> 34:44.230
Miss, you're stunning.

34:46.150 --> 34:47.080
Ms. Fairy!

34:47.110 --> 34:48.530
Ms. Fairy!

34:50.760 --> 34:51.920
Everyone, welcome

34:52.230 --> 34:53.830
to the Realm of Mist and Void.

34:54.100 --> 34:55.560
The Realm of Mist and Void?

34:56.150 --> 34:57.400
Aren't we in Penglang?

34:57.400 --> 34:59.400
That's what humans call this place.

34:59.800 --> 35:00.650
This island

35:00.840 --> 35:03.370
lies between the human realm
and the immortal realm.

35:03.370 --> 35:07.030
For divine beings, this place is called
the Realm of Mist and Void.

35:07.210 --> 35:08.450
Since this is the immortal realm,

35:08.450 --> 35:10.450
you must all be fairies, aren't you?

35:11.360 --> 35:13.630
We are disciples of the Exalted Immortal.

35:13.630 --> 35:15.370
If fate has it that you stay,

35:15.630 --> 35:17.430
you will become sisters with us.

35:17.780 --> 35:19.030
We might get to stay!

35:19.630 --> 35:20.960
We could be fairies too!

35:20.960 --> 35:22.280
I may become a fairy!

35:22.280 --> 35:24.840
I am Bingzhu,
the Demon Slayer of the Feiyu Guard

35:24.840 --> 35:26.100
of Tiansheng Kingdom.

35:26.190 --> 35:27.480
By order of His Majesty,

35:27.480 --> 35:29.670
I've brought 100 Tiansheng maidens
to serve

35:29.670 --> 35:30.930
the Exalted Immortal.

35:33.920 --> 35:35.120
Leave the girls to us.

35:35.400 --> 35:36.980
You may go now.

35:37.110 --> 35:39.120
Assigned by the Emperor to this task,

35:39.120 --> 35:41.190
I must see the Exalted Immortal in person,

35:41.190 --> 35:43.630
or I will have no report
to deliver to His Majesty.

35:43.630 --> 35:46.150
The Realm of Mist and Void
is a paradise for women.

35:46.150 --> 35:47.480
Filthy mortal men are never allowed

35:47.480 --> 35:48.940
to set foot on this island.

35:49.480 --> 35:50.960
Your very presence in this sea of flowers

35:50.960 --> 35:52.110
is already an exception.

35:52.110 --> 35:54.310
The Exalted Immortal has her own rules.

35:54.360 --> 35:55.410
As an official,

35:55.710 --> 35:57.550
I have duties to fulfill as well.

35:58.280 --> 35:59.590
These 100 maidens

35:59.880 --> 36:02.680
were carefully selected
from Tiansheng Kingdom.

36:02.800 --> 36:04.110
It is my duty

36:04.280 --> 36:05.710
to protect them

36:05.710 --> 36:07.370
and to hand over each and every

36:07.440 --> 36:09.440
one of them to the Exalted Immortal.

36:15.920 --> 36:16.710
So...

36:18.710 --> 36:20.800
you insist on meeting
the Exalted Immortal?

36:20.800 --> 36:22.000
I'm only doing my job.

36:24.900 --> 36:27.160
You have to know
the Realm of Mist and Void

36:27.440 --> 36:29.710
has never been trodden by a human male.

36:31.430 --> 36:33.890
If you persist in being the first one
to do so,

36:34.280 --> 36:35.400
then I'm afraid

36:35.800 --> 36:37.330
you'll also be the last one.

36:42.090 --> 36:44.220
As long as I get to complete the mission

36:44.440 --> 36:45.640
given by His Majesty,

36:46.550 --> 36:48.080
I don't mind losing my life.

36:50.440 --> 36:51.700
In that case,

36:52.960 --> 36:54.800
come with us, Demon Slayer.

36:58.280 --> 36:58.670
Let's go.

36:58.670 --> 36:59.660
Be quick. Move along.

36:59.660 --> 37:00.860
-Let's go.
-Come on.

37:00.960 --> 37:02.310
Let's follow them.

37:02.480 --> 37:03.230
Keep up!

37:06.860 --> 37:07.670
This is great!

37:07.690 --> 37:09.520
We're about to meet the Exalted Immortal!

37:09.520 --> 37:10.280
Wait for me!

37:12.570 --> 37:13.710
Come here. Hurry!

37:15.960 --> 37:16.950
Get a move on.

37:20.190 --> 37:20.840
Madam,

37:21.950 --> 37:24.010
what kind of flowers are you growing?

37:26.920 --> 37:28.510
These aren't flowers,

37:29.710 --> 37:31.030
but human hearts.

37:32.510 --> 37:33.860
These flowers bloom

37:34.190 --> 37:35.630
only to wither.

37:36.580 --> 37:38.160
They fall off

37:38.550 --> 37:40.560
for the fruit to set.

37:41.360 --> 37:44.810
Then many, many human hearts
will be produced.

37:45.400 --> 37:46.600
The Exalted Immortal

37:47.360 --> 37:49.190
loves them most.

37:52.670 --> 37:53.960
Ladies, the three of you

37:53.960 --> 37:55.990
are breathtakingly beautiful.

37:56.010 --> 37:57.210
I've never seen anyone

37:57.210 --> 37:59.340
as pretty as you are in the human realm.

37:59.790 --> 38:01.150
Then try picking

38:01.270 --> 38:03.080
the most gorgeous one out of us.

38:03.460 --> 38:05.650
You are each beautiful in your own way.

38:05.770 --> 38:07.990
Well, how am I supposed to make a pick?

38:08.400 --> 38:09.910
But you have to.

38:10.360 --> 38:11.320
You will be rewarded

38:11.320 --> 38:12.740
if you do a good job at it.

38:13.000 --> 38:13.710
That said,

38:13.710 --> 38:15.650
the lady in front is wearing a veil.

38:15.670 --> 38:17.000
We can't see her face.

38:17.490 --> 38:18.740
Then just go ahead

38:18.770 --> 38:20.130
and ask her to remove the veil

38:20.130 --> 38:21.390
so you can see her face.

38:21.510 --> 38:22.150
Miss!

38:24.440 --> 38:26.570
Back there, we were just talking about

38:26.590 --> 38:27.770
how captivating

38:27.840 --> 38:29.030
your eyes are.

38:29.400 --> 38:30.920
We're curious about the beauty

38:30.920 --> 38:31.980
beneath your veil.

38:32.000 --> 38:32.840
Yeah, Ms. Fairy.

38:32.840 --> 38:33.920
Please, show us your face.

38:33.920 --> 38:35.380
We'd love to see your face!

38:36.190 --> 38:37.190
Don't wander off.

38:38.710 --> 38:39.700
Lu Pianpian,

38:40.470 --> 38:41.800
they've been chattering all the way

38:41.800 --> 38:43.130
about your appearance.

38:43.190 --> 38:44.650
It's getting on my nerves.

38:44.890 --> 38:46.290
Just show them your face.

38:47.320 --> 38:48.450
Please let us see your face.

38:48.450 --> 38:49.660
Ms. Fairy!

38:50.070 --> 38:50.840
One glimpse is fine.

38:50.840 --> 38:53.100
Pianpian, your beauty is unparalleled.

38:53.320 --> 38:55.880
Why not let these human girls
see for themselves?

38:55.880 --> 38:56.680
That's right!

38:58.160 --> 39:00.160
Please show us your face, Ms. Fairy!

39:00.280 --> 39:01.840
Let us see your face, miss!

39:02.280 --> 39:03.310
Please!

39:18.840 --> 39:20.610
Why is there such a big scar?

39:20.960 --> 39:22.130
How could this be?

39:23.230 --> 39:24.110
Girls, are you

39:24.400 --> 39:25.800
satisfied now?

39:28.390 --> 39:30.250
I willingly accepted punishment

39:30.320 --> 39:31.520
for making a mistake.

39:31.960 --> 39:33.880
Out of mercy, the Exalted Immortal

39:33.880 --> 39:35.630
only left this mark on my face

39:35.630 --> 39:36.840
as a warning.

39:36.960 --> 39:38.710
If you're lucky to stay,

39:38.920 --> 39:40.320
learn from my experience

39:40.710 --> 39:42.740
and don't make the same mistake.

39:43.590 --> 39:45.850
She who does wrong
gets a scar on the face?

39:46.320 --> 39:47.360
How terrifying.

39:49.150 --> 39:51.680
This fairy here is beautiful
beyond compare.

39:52.330 --> 39:53.470
Pretty or ugly—

39:54.550 --> 39:56.480
it's only a matter of perspective.

39:59.110 --> 40:01.110
Though your appearance is damaged,

40:01.570 --> 40:03.460
your dignity remains intact.

40:04.740 --> 40:06.410
That is unassailable.

40:10.140 --> 40:12.790
I didn't expect Bingzhu
to be such a smooth talker.

40:12.790 --> 40:14.450
I'll never believe him again.

40:17.110 --> 40:18.710
You've seen my face already.

40:22.400 --> 40:23.530
Let's keep walking.

40:28.690 --> 40:30.170
Let's go. Hurry.

40:32.190 --> 40:32.840
Everyone,

40:33.360 --> 40:34.770
we have to stop here.

40:34.910 --> 40:37.030
The Exalted Immortal never recruits
those without celestial potential.

40:37.030 --> 40:38.880
Please stay here and take a rest.

40:39.410 --> 40:41.550
Only those who pass
the trial of the Realm of Mist and Void

40:41.550 --> 40:42.820
and show outstanding talent

40:42.820 --> 40:44.190
can reside permanently.

40:44.190 --> 40:45.340
Trial?

40:45.480 --> 40:46.410
There's a trial?

40:46.640 --> 40:49.150
We're all holy maidens
chosen by Tiansheng Kingdom.

40:49.150 --> 40:50.280
Before coming here,

40:50.280 --> 40:51.630
we went through
a rigorous selection process.

40:51.630 --> 40:52.760
That's right!

40:52.760 --> 40:53.290
Exactly.

40:53.440 --> 40:56.550
The selection in the human realm
differs from that in the immortal realm.

40:56.550 --> 40:58.750
The trial consists of multiple rounds.

41:00.860 --> 41:03.000
When will we get to
drink from Yuli Spring?

41:03.000 --> 41:03.550
Yeah.

41:03.910 --> 41:06.840
Anyone not willing to follow
the rules of the Realm of Mist and Void

41:06.840 --> 41:08.070
may exit now.

41:11.830 --> 41:13.840
I can see that none of your want to leave.

41:13.840 --> 41:14.880
Ying Ning, Pei,

41:15.340 --> 41:16.950
bring them to their abodes.

41:17.030 --> 41:17.630
Hold on.

41:23.360 --> 41:24.420
These young ladies

41:25.400 --> 41:28.400
are seen as precious treasures
in Tiansheng Kingdom.

41:29.000 --> 41:31.800
Miss, I hope to be informed in advance
if there will be danger

41:31.800 --> 41:34.280
in the trial
of the Realm of Mist and Void.

41:34.280 --> 41:35.390
Demon Slayer,

41:35.420 --> 41:36.480
are you suggesting

41:37.080 --> 41:39.140
you'd like to take the trial for them?

41:40.190 --> 41:41.390
It's up to the maidens

41:42.050 --> 41:44.380
to decide
whether to take the trial or not.

41:44.880 --> 41:46.230
I just have to make sure

41:46.560 --> 41:48.220
that each and every one of them

41:48.330 --> 41:50.160
remains completely unscathed.

41:50.320 --> 41:51.520
They will, of course.

41:54.760 --> 41:56.420
What's wrong? Did she spot us?

41:57.230 --> 41:58.070
The two of you,

41:58.840 --> 41:59.480
come here.

42:00.390 --> 42:01.240
Who?

42:01.750 --> 42:03.280
Those two girls at the back,

42:03.800 --> 42:04.760
turn around.

42:05.450 --> 42:06.860
We're done for.

42:09.110 --> 42:10.240
She meant those two.

42:13.670 --> 42:14.700
Here we meet again.
